{
 "bio": {
  "lang": "en",
  "script": "Latn",
  "text": "Alex Abreham is one of the most influential young voices in modern Amharic literature. His bestselling books have earned wide acclaim for their powerful exploration of love, injustice, and social change, blending Ethiopian tradition with contemporary storytelling. አሌክስ አብርሃም ባለፉት አስር አመታት በአማርኛ ስነፅሁፍ ከተከሰቱ ወጣት ፀሐፊያን በግንባር ቀደምትነት የሚጠቀስ ስም ነው በተከታታይ ያሳተማቸው መፅሐፍት"
 },
